---
description: cv.json content and project image pipeline
globs: "cv.json,scripts/**/*.{mjs,js},public/projects/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Content (`cv.json`)

- Single source of truth for bio, work, projects, skills, education, languages
- Components import via `@cv` — do not duplicate facts in UI code
- New/updated project:
  1. Set `imageSource` (URL or `assets/project-shots/…`)
  2. Prefer `pnpm run images:capture` for live demos, or `pnpm run images:projects`
  3. Commit `cv.json`, `public/projects/*.webp`, and new shot sources
- Slugs come from `slugifyProjectName` in `src/utils/projects.ts` — renaming a project changes its URL
